{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-4","storyName":"旧舞步","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"库林拖拽雕像来到广场，试图唤起人们的理智，却在人群狂怒的包围中死去。而后，紫火延烧，爱布拉娜降临......第一个残缺的故事就此结束，第二个则缓缓拉开帷幕。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["狂热的居民","焦急的居民","寡言的居民","库林","涅梅丝","拉芙希妮","沉默的人群","狂怒的人群","友善的居民","爱布拉娜","神秘的女性","作家"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_59_g3_dragonsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","yFrom":"0","xTo":"-100","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","duration":"35","block":"false","id":5},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","grad":"false","fadetime":"0.1","id":6},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","grad":"false","fadetime":"0.1","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodcracle","volume":"0.8","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"成百上千年前，塔拉人的先祖也曾这样，在秋末冬初的旷野上点起一簇又一簇篝火。","id":13},{"type":"text","text":"那时他们依偎着红龙睡下，他们炽热的梦被风沙打磨得粗粝，却仍然足以温暖彼此的身躯。","id":14},{"type":"text","text":"当他们醒来时，篝火不会熄灭，因为红龙不眠。","id":15},{"type":"text","text":"只是呼吸着那些从篝火里悠悠升上天空的，关于家园、美酒与自由的梦，红龙便能从疲惫与苦痛中得到片刻休憩。","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"而今天，夏末节又要到了，人们去附近拆下废墟里的木料点起篝火，却全然忘记了那古老、闲适、宛如永恒的时光。","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":19},{"type":"curtain","fadetime":"1","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":21},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_59_g3_dragonsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"把手放到火上。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"你看我腰上灯的颜色，我是塔拉人，我受过红龙的祝福。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"难道间谍想不到要伪造灯的颜色吗？别磨磨蹭蹭的！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"愿......","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"愿红龙垂怜！","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodcracle","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":35},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"3","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"唔......也......不是很痛。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"真的不痛？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"你看，甚至连烧伤的痕迹都不太明显。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"那你就不是维多利亚间谍。你周围还有谁没来这儿试验过？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_59_g3_dragonsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寡言的居民","text":"......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"你，就是你，你去那边烧过手吗？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寡言的居民","text":"......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"说句话，别摸你那脏兮兮的破绳结了！跟我走！","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":61},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"我让你跟我走！把绳结放下——","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.6","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"你——你打我？！","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寡言的居民","text":"绳结......你敢......","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"算了，我不抢你的绳结，跟我去那边，看看你是不是维多利亚间谍！","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1752_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":80},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.8","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodcracle","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"寡言的居民默默站起身，迈着不大利索的步伐往篝火的方向走去。","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"广场已经被彻底的混乱占据。","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"只不过，一半的混乱来自怀疑、仇恨和得不出任何结果的暴怒，另一半却来自绝望的眼神和死一般的寂静......","id":98},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3.5","id":100},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"3.5","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"0.3","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"0.3","loop":"false","channel":"red","delay":"2","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"0.6","loop":"false","channel":"red1","delay":"4","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":106},{"type":"text","text":"直到远处微细的拖拽声传来。","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"1","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"那声音越来越大，越来越大，直到盖过一切嘈杂与混乱。","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"所有人都听见了巨物被人拖拽，逐渐接近的声音。","id":110},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_59_i04.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":116},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"180","yFrom":"-60","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":117},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ghosthunter_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ghosthunter_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":118,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"0.6","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"0.8","loop":"false","channel":"reda","delay":"3","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"redb","delay":"6","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"redc","delay":"9","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":124},{"type":"text","text":"一瞬间，所有旁的声音都寂灭了，只剩下钢铁颤抖，齿轮颤动。","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"为潮湿薄雾所掩映的，是冰冷而庞大的雕像轮廓。","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"由英雄所铸，在所有人印象中都还未完成的红龙先祖雕像，献给塔拉的礼物。它披着将死的猛烈日光到来，却几乎遮蔽了天幕。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"红龙雕像......活过来了？","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"不，那是——库林？！","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"库林，你也来帮大家揪出维多利亚人了？","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"他得先证明他自己不是！","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"库林，你快来，听我说，只要不是维多利亚人，就算被火烧了也不会很痛——","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"你聋了吗！过来！","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"慢着，他......","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"他就这么，一个人，把那整座雕像拖了过来？！","id":137},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"人们终于看清他如何将铁链挽在手臂上，一圈、两圈、三圈，而雕像的重量全系于那宽阔，却也只属于区区凡人的肩头。","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"被呼唤名字的英雄不为所动地前进。他的肩膀磨出鲜血，他的肌肉濒临撕裂，他的骨骼发出悲鸣，而他只是走着。","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的英雄走在雕像的身前，无惧于这庞然大物将他映衬得极端渺小，他只是迈步，再迈步，沉重，笃定，走向无人阻挡的前方。","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reddragonstatue","volume":"1","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"image","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_land_impact","volume":"0.7","id":150},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":152},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"英雄已将雕像停放于广场中央的空地上，然后艰难地转过身，面向眼前的所有人。","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"钢铁骨架周身带着冰冷的瑰丽，凝固在振翅欲飞的动作中，仿佛它本就应该在那里，从一切的最初开始，就在那里。","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_59_g3_dragonsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"停手吧，同胞们。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"在杀死更多的同胞之前，停手吧。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"一时之间，没人胆敢作声。","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"仇恨仍在，怀疑仍在，让人如行尸走肉般无力前行的伤痛仍在。","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"但眼前的人是英雄。他守护了纳斯尔纱。他将祝福与诅咒一路拖行至此，他身后的雕像为他说的每一句话平添了十足的威严。","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"谁杀死同胞了？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"现在是火烧，如果还找不出间谍，然后呢？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"......","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"库林他，真的把雕像拖了过来......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"怎么办？我们要......打断他吗？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":195},{"type":"charslot","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"而且，粮食不是回来了吗？战争不是结束了吗？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"就算真的有间谍，为什么全城的人只为了一个卑劣的间谍，就都聚集在这里伤害彼此？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#12$1","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"让他......说完吧。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我再说一遍，战争结束了。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"战争刚结束的时候，我想的事情很简单，等比我更好的工匠来了，我要跟他学两手，别总是连自己打的东西都不能修。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"multiline","name":"库林","text":"但工匠......","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"multiline","name":"库林","text":"没有来，我也没学到什么手艺，甚至把大家生活所需的东西都铸进雕像里了。","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我不该这么做。纳斯尔纱现在什么都缺。哪怕就是个空碗，总能接点雨水，也比熔进这座雕像上发光，却什么都做不到要强，强太多。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"还有粮食，昨天我真的急坏了，我真怕城里缺粮到无法挽回的地步，还好，也许是红龙垂怜，也许是某个地块丰产，总之，粮食回来了。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"只要人还在，我们就总能挺过去的，不是吗？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"但提奥......不在了。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"你还在可怜那个维多利亚的坏种？！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"对，我可怜他，听见他死讯的时候，我恨所有人，包括我自己。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"维多利亚人做了什么，你比我们知道！","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"维多利亚人用最后的力气伏在提奥身上，求我将他带走。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我恨你们，我甚至想找每一个对提奥见死不救的人复仇。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"可复仇总该有个理由，不是吗？我们复仇，究竟是为了什么？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"我们可以去抢，就像当年他们抢我们一样！","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"连斧头都熔进了雕像的纳斯尔纱，真的能从维多利亚人手中抢来一颗谷粒吗？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1689_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寡言的居民","text":"去让那些混蛋感受我们感受过的痛苦。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1689_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"是啊，就像我现在也想让你们感受死在巷子里的痛苦一样。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"可同胞们为我们死去，就是为了让我们活下来。现在，为了让别人感受痛苦，我们就要再带着这条命去死吗？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"难道你要我们去爱他们吗？去爱那些夺走我们的收成，杀死我们的亲人的人？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"不，没人需要去爱自己的敌人。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我只希望你们能爱活着的人......爱你们自己。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"甚至，我都不需要你们去爱谁，我只想问你们一个问题。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"等到明天，等到夏末节过去，等到战争的影子终于离开我们的头顶......你们准备做点什么？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我原本想的是建好雕像，把名字刻在上面，但现在，我只想找个好点的工匠，学会怎么修假腿。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的人群","text":"......","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"我不知道你今天怎么这么会说话，库林，但我不管明天怎么样，战争怎么样，我只要维多利亚人死。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"如果你替维多利亚人说话，那我也要你死。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"......","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"好。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":279},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_twohandedblunt","volume":"1","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"库林抡起锻造了整个雕像的大锤，对准巨龙的头颅。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"但这雕像实在花了他太多心血，在抡起的那一刻犹豫，这一锤就再也砸不下去。","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"人群还以为这是某种仪式，一时没有反应过来他要做什么。","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"可当他们发觉库林不是要祭祀，而是要破坏的时候，就连最像行尸走肉的人也不由得嚎叫出声，他们在一瞬间冲向库林，将他团团围住。","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"库林，别做傻事！","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"涅梅丝的悲鸣淹没在人群的呼喊当中，而库林洪亮的嗓音仍然清晰可辨。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮想冲到库林身前，却被狂怒的人群挡住去路。她咬紧嘴唇，试图用火焰赶开人群，试图用喊声吸引人群的注意。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"可偏偏此时，人们像失了知觉一般......","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"或者，他们真的失去了知觉也说不定。","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我来毁掉这座雕像，就为了把之前从你们手里拿走的生活还给你们。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂怒的人群","text":"你竟敢说毁掉？！","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我记得每一根骨头用什么铸成，我要把脊椎铸回刀斧，肋骨铸回碗盆，头颅铸回桌椅，然后还给你们。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂怒的人群","text":"叛徒！你这样的英雄，怎么会成了叛徒？！","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"如果不忍心夺走别人的生活就是叛徒，那我从一开始就不是英雄，而是叛徒。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂怒的人群","text":"还在狡辩！","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"狡辩？","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我告诉你们库林是谁，库林不是英雄，他只是一个沽名钓誉的骗子。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"他宣称自己在黑林中杀死了一队维多利亚斥候，可他遇见维多利亚人的地方根本不是黑林，而在更远的地方......","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"而那些维多利亚人也根本不是什么斥候，只是一支可怜的，不知被哪家军队蹂躏过的商队。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"库林无论如何都想救下他们，可最终，他只保住了一个孩子。维多利亚孩子。他不知如何是好。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"最终，不知是无计可施，还是虚荣作祟，他决定割下那几个维多利亚人的首级，告诉自己的同胞，他们是一支斥候分队。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"这样，他就成了英雄，他成了城里最有威望的平民，他觉得自己可以借此为城里人做许多事。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"而抚养那个孩子长大，也就成了英雄的一点怜悯。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂怒的人群","text":"你？！","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"就是这样一个可怜的骗子，尚且知道自己是个铁匠，自己应该在战争结束后，学点什么东西。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"可你们......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"你们呢？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1697_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"你——你不是库林！你是假扮库林的骗子！","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1688_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","id":345},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":347},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":348},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"咳......","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1695_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的居民","text":"对，你不是库林！库林是我们的英雄，是一整队维多利亚斥候都打不倒的硬汉！你到底是什么人？！","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_npc_1695_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$dignified_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":358,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"哈......","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"你们觉得，把这座雕像从工坊拖到这里之后......","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"我......还有多长时间好活？","id":361},{"type":"dialog","id":362},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"像是说完了最后一句话一样，鲜血从库林的口鼻中汩汩流出。","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"他几乎是带着慈祥而期盼的神情，看向周围的同胞，希望他们脸上能露出些除了仇恨以外的表情。","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"但他恍惚觉得，自己只看到一片紫色的火，火后面的人脸模糊不清，像很久很久以前，他在某处遗迹外面遇见的不得安宁的死者。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"他向远处望去。","id":368},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"咳、咳！","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"他在广场边缘的某个拐角看见了一个小小的身影。","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"他还没来得及去寻找的提奥的尸身，此刻正带着肉眼可见的紫火，怔怔地看着他。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"提奥？怎么连你也？！","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"咳......","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库林","text":"都白费了......白费了......","id":375},{"type":"dialog","id":376},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1697_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":380},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":382},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_twohandedblunt","volume":"1","id":383},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":384},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"库林摇摇晃晃地站起来，捡起铁锤抡圆。","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"charslot","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"人群紧盯着他，害怕那柄铁锤落到自己的脑袋上，却又不肯离开。","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"而库林用尽最后一点力气......","id":390},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hammersmash_statue","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"狠狠敲向巨龙的头颅。","id":398},{"type":"text","text":"如同为谁敲响丧钟。","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":402},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_bg_47_g15_eveningglow_L2.png","screenadapt":"showall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"英雄的身躯倒在巨龙身前，人群如同一下子被抽去了什么一般茫然若失。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮的声音终于传了开去，她的火焰如爆燃的夕阳，却仍无法吸引任何一个人的注意。","id":406},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_59_g3_dragonsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":409},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_deathfire","volume":"1","id":410},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_eblana_attack","layer":"1","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":412},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","y":"-50","layer":"2","id":413},{"type":"playsound","key":"$burningloop1","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"fire","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"正在此时，雕像，连同雕像前静静地躺着的库林，突然燃起烛天的紫火，人群出于本能地为那火焰后退。","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"火中，库林缓缓直起身体，而巨大的雕塑伸展翅膀，几欲起身。","id":417},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","y":"20","layer":"3","id":419},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":420},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"b","fadetime":"1","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":422},{"type":"dialog","id":423},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chimerawings","volume":"0.8","id":424},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chimerawings","volume":"1","channel":"f","delay":"1.5","id":425},{"type":"text","text":"直到库林真的站起，红龙的雕塑也真的扇动巨大的翅膀，飞向此前一直为它准备的，广场中央，空空如也的台座——","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fire","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":431},{"type":"charslot","id":432},{"type":"bgeffect","id":433},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":435},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":437},{"type":"text","text":"人群沉默地注视着这一切，不知是木然还是敬畏。","id":438},{"type":"text","text":"堡垒的方向，那飘渺的脚步声姗姗来迟。","id":439},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#7$1","duration":"0.7","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"多遗憾啊，我来迟了，这座城市里仅剩的英雄。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那么，纳斯尔纱的居民们，在你们的英雄为雕像而献身之后......","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"夜幕降临，如果你们仍遵循红龙的意志......","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"宵禁时间将至，你们该回家了。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"char","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":452},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":454},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":455},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":456},{"type":"charslot","id":457},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":459},{"type":"char","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":462,"musicid":3},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":463},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":464},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clapsolo","volume":"1","id":465},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"“而他用尽最后一点力气，狠狠敲向巨龙的头颅，如同为谁敲响丧钟”......","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您真的很喜欢库林。虽然这是个很悲伤的结局，但您把它“创作”得很美。","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"谬赞。","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"这位铁匠和我根本没打过几次照面。他只是城中混乱的第一个牺牲品，如果不算提奥的话。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"还有，其实我很好奇的一点是，您觉得那些走入黑暗的深池，他们身上有您所谓的“紫火”吗？","id":473},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"恕不奉告。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"按照您故事里的说法，我觉得应该是没有的。贪污、走私、滥权......他们对未来可有着不少构想呢。","id":477},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"讲了这么多，你应该可以给这个故事填上个结局了。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":482},{"type":"charslot","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"城里可不止发生了这一件事，您自己也说了，他只是第一个牺牲品。","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"不过，如果您非要在这截断的话......","id":485},{"type":"dialog","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":488},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>红龙笃定被死火侵染的人们已经无药可救。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":489},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>因此，她向人们宣布，这里将成为死的国度，而这些人会成为她的追随者，随她开启向着死亡的探险。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":490},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>如行尸走肉的人们已经无力表达同意或是拒绝。那一夜，冲天的火光照亮了整片原野，此后再也没人见过红龙和她的那些追随者。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":491},{"type":"subtitle","id":492},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":493},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"呃......","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"怎么了？","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"没什么。你可以走了。","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您明明就还有话想说。","id":502},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......","id":504,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"此后真的再也没人见过红龙吗？","id":506,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":507},{"type":"charslot","id":508},{"type":"text","text":"作家看向酒馆一侧无人问津的报栏。当天的报纸就放在那里，“领袖”的照片出现在头版。看标题，她正在橡林郡参加什么仪式。","id":509},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"还有，“随她开启向着死亡的探险”......红龙什么时候做了这种事？","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"故事是自由的。","id":513},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"自由，没错，但自由不代表一拍脑袋，然后一笑了之。","id":515,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"为什么不行？","id":517},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":518},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"因为你、我，我们是塔拉人，我们的故事无论如何歪曲，都映照着我们自己。","id":519,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"你还承认自己是塔拉人？","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"从我第一次读到那个名叫西莫·威廉姆斯的诗人写的句子开始，我就一直是塔拉人。","id":523,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"不然我为什么放弃开夏郡文学沙龙里温暖的扶手椅，跑到塔拉去做一名——","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":527},{"type":"charslot","id":528},{"type":"text","text":"“你还承认自己是塔拉人？”","id":529},{"type":"text","text":"作家脑海中突然闪过一个极为不祥的念头，但他立刻将其否定。","id":530},{"type":"text","text":"他再次看了一眼报栏。报纸只报道事实，哪怕是经过裁剪的，那也是事实。","id":531},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"我直接问吧，谁派你来的？","id":533,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"没有人命令我。如您所说，我只是一个对您的故事和“拼凑真相”都格外感兴趣的读者罢了。","id":535},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"你怎么证明？","id":537,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":538},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"这下您可难倒我了。证明有人派我来很简单，可我该怎么证明不存在这么个人物呢？","id":539},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":540},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......","id":541,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":542},{"type":"charslot","id":543},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","volume":"1","id":544},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":545},{"type":"text","text":"作家又灌了一口酒，懊丧地抱住头。他知道自己一时半会儿是逃不掉了。","id":546},{"type":"text","text":"但事情还有转机。只要自己足够聪明......","id":547},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":548},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"仔细想想，的确，不过是故事罢了，我有点神经过敏，抱歉。","id":549,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":550},{"type":"charslot","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"而且您那些半截子的故事也还剩下不少呢。","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"或许，把它们连在一起，我们就能得到真正和那段时日的纳斯尔纱，和您心中的塔拉相称的结局了。","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"如果您已经准备好了，下一个故事，我们能讲讲那场镜中的舞吗？","id":554},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"镜中的舞......是吗？","id":556,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":557},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":558},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":559},{"type":"text","text":"不，不是聪不聪明的问题。","id":560},{"type":"text","text":"只要自己足够谨慎，让火焰映照出的故事的影子升腾、变幻，自己一定会没事的。","id":561},{"type":"dialog","id":562},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":563},{"type":"charslot","id":564},{"type":"image","id":565}],"characters":["狂热的居民","焦急的居民","寡言的居民","库林","涅梅丝","拉芙希妮","沉默的人群","狂怒的人群","友善的居民","爱布拉娜","神秘的女性","作家"]}